- we have no build step today and I'd rather not add one just for this file. If minification really matters, tell me and I'll add it
- point out real bugs, I don't need style nitpicks

```javascript
// landing.js: pricing toggle, FAQ accordion, newsletter signup

const PRICES = {
  starter: { monthly: 9, yearly: 90 },
