Please review the landing page for our city marathon. Requirements: the hero photo must show fast, the photo gallery stays, and the start list has to stay searchable by name or bib number. We have about 6,000 runners in `data/runners.json`. Mobile visitors are most of our traffic. Tell me what you would change and why.

```html
