In Green Metrics Tool browser benchmarks (30 cold page loads, client CPU energy), six local TTF files (~4 MB) used ~556 J. Two Latin-subset WOFF2 files (~55 KB) used ~488 J, about 12% less. The system font stack used ~410 J, about 26% less than TTF.

