Requirements from our sustainability lead: I need to put a number in the quarterly report, kWh and CO2 per year saved if we move this to CSS. Roughly 150 analysts use the page, and they often keep the tab open for a whole shift while syncs run. Please give me the number. If you can't, tell me what I can write instead and how to get a real one. Also, the spinner must stop when the sync ends, and we respect prefers-reduced-motion.

