1. Make two builds of the connector page, one with the rAF spinner and one with the CSS spinner.
2. Run each in the same browser on the same machine for a fixed time, for example 5 minutes with one sync running, as a Green Metrics Tool usage scenario. Also record a run with no spinner as a baseline.
3. Take the difference between the two builds per minute. Multiply by the real hours of running syncs per analyst and by the number of analysts. Convert with your own grid carbon intensity.

