- **Precompressed static files** (reduces E and network): the 40 MB summaries are compressed once per publish, not once per download. In Green Metrics Tool nginx benchmarks with text assets, compressing on every request cost about 4× the CPU energy of serving precompressed files, and compression sent about 10× fewer bytes than none.
